    "body": "<!-- For information about contributing see: https://github.com/supercollider/supercollider/wiki/Contributing-directory -->\n<!-- Please check there isn't already an issue on this topic. -->\n\nHello,\n\nThis message was written with the help of AI to solve an issue, when crashing the server with supernova. \nI do not know if it the best way to solve it.\nBut with this fix, there is no longer supernova crash.\n\n## Environment\n\n* SuperCollider version: Latest Dev\n* Operating system: MacOS 27\n* Other details (Qt version, audio driver, etc.): Qt 6.8 & 6.11.2\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n```supercollider\nServer.supernova; // switch to the supernova executable\ns.reboot;\ns.waitForBoot({\n    {IFFT(FFT(LocalBuf(2048), SinOsc.ar(440)))}.play;\n});\n```\n\n## Expected vs. actual behavior\n\n**Expected:** the synth plays normally, like it does under scsynth.\n\n**Actual:** supernova crashes with `EXC_BAD_ACCESS` the moment the FFT\nUGen is constructed.\n\n## Problem\n\n**File:** `server/supernova/sc/sc_plugin_interface.cpp`,\n`sc_plugin_interface::initialize()`\n\nscsynth's `World_New()` points `world->ft` at its `InterfaceTable`\n(`SC_World.cpp`: `world->ft = &gInterfaceTable;`). supernova's\nequivalent, `sc_plugin_interface::initialize()`, fills in its own\n`sc_interface` but never assigns it to `world.ft`.\n\nRegular UGen plugins aren't affected \u2014 they use their own file-local\n`ft`, set via `load(InterfaceTable*)` at load time. But generic engine\ncode that only has a `World*` \u2014 `SCWorld_Allocator` in\n`SC_InterfaceTable.h`, used by `scfft_create`/`scfft_destroy` for\n`FFT_UGens`/`PV_ThirdParty`/`ML_UGens` \u2014 dereferences `world->ft`\ndirectly. Since `sc_factory` is allocated via `new sc_ugen_factory`\n(default-init, not value-init), that `World` struct member is never\nzeroed, so this reliably crashes with `EXC_BAD_ACCESS` (dereferencing a\ngarbage pointer) the first time any FFT-based UGen is constructed \u2014\nlazily, via `sc_synth::prepare()`, on the audio thread.\n\n## Possible Fix\n\n**File to modify:** `server/supernova/sc/sc_plugin_interface.cpp`\n**Function:** `sc_plugin_interface::initialize()`\n**Change:** one line, right after `sc_interface` is fully populated and\nbefore `world` is otherwise initialized.\n\n```diff\n     sc_interface.fDoAsynchronousCommandEx = &do_asynchronous_command_ex;\n     sc_interface.fDoAsyncUnitCommand = &do_async_unit_command;\n \n+    world.ft = &sc_interface;\n+\n     /* initialize world */\n     /* control busses */\n     world.mControlBus = control_busses;\n```\n",
